# Generated artifacts: `pinn-sfr reference` rebuilds results/ (figure + .npz) on
# demand and the CLI recreates the directory, so the binaries are not tracked.
/results/

# NO IMAGES IN THIS REPOSITORY, anywhere, ever.
#
# `docs/` is text and tables: a committed plot is a number that stops tracking the
# code that produced it, and a figure cannot be grepped against a
# `__DEV/studies/*.json` row the way AGENTS.md requires every published number to
# be.
#
# The nine PNGs under `docs/img/` went two different ways, deliberately. The three
# added on this branch (`axial_feedback`, `axial_fields`, `axial_front`) were
# purged from every feat-only commit by a history rewrite. The six inherited from
# `main` are deleted here as an ordinary commit and left in `main`'s history --
# rewriting a published branch to save 600 kB is not a trade worth making.
#
# The plotting code is kept -- `pinn-sfr figures`, `pinn-sfr axial figures` and
# `python -m pinn_sfr_transient.axial.charts` -- and now draws into `results/`,
# which is ignored above. Look at them locally; do not commit them.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.webp
*.svg
*.ico
*.pdf

# Scratch / pasted logs (e.g. CI run logs saved locally)
*.log

# Concatenation of the mirrored manual chapters, written by
# `tools/fetch_sas_manual.py --combined`. It duplicates docs/sas4a/ChNN.txt
# exactly and exceeds the 1 MB file limit.
/docs/sas4a/ALL.txt

# Local working notes.
/__DEV/
